Package: MS1Match
Title: MS1Match for Library-guided Annotation and Grouping of Re-dundant MS1 Features in LC-MS Untargeted Metabolomics
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Ruibing", "Shi", email = "ruibingshi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Annotates redundant MS1 features in LC-MS untargeted metabolomics
    (adducts, isotopes and in-source fragments) by matching them to an MS1
    reference library built from pure standards. Features are grouped per
    compound and assigned to evidence tiers, optionally supported by MS2
    fragment matching. The resulting reference groups can be used to
    benchmark feature-grouping tools.
URL: https://ruibings.github.io/MS1Match_Rpackage, https://github.com/RuibingS/MS1Match_Rpackage
BugReports: https://github.com/RuibingS/MS1Match_Rpackage/issues
